flowchart TD
    P[Process] --> C[Credentials]
    C --> FSUID[fsuid / fsgid]
    C --> Groups[supplementary groups]
    C --> Cap[capabilities]

    Obj[Kernel object] --> File[file / directory]
    Obj --> Sock[socket]
    Obj --> Dev[device]

    FSUID --> Check[Permission check]
    Groups --> Check
    Cap --> Check
    File --> Check
    Sock --> Check
    Dev --> Check

    Check --> Allow[allow]
    Check --> Deny[deny]
